Welcome to the IDReader UA mobile app!

With this app, using the phone’s NFC module, you can read and verify data from the following documents:
•	Passport of the Citizen of Ukraine (ID card);
•	Passport of the Citizen of Ukraine for traveling abroad;
•	Permanent residence permit;
•	Temporary residence permit;
•	Crew member certificate.

For Passports of the Citizen of Ukraine (ID cards), Permanent residence permits, and Temporary residence permits, the following features are available:
•	Reading data using CAN, PIN1 and PIN2;
•	Changing PIN1, PIN2, and their respective PUK1, PUK2;
•	Unlocking PIN1, PIN2 using PUK1, PUK2;
•	Saving the read-out data as a PDF file.

For Passports of the Citizen of Ukraine for traveling abroad and Crew member certificates, the following features are available:
•	Reading data using the Machine Readable Zone (MRZ);
•	Saving the read-out data as a PDF file.

The app is available in two languages: Ukrainian and English. The language is automatically selected depending on the phone’s settings.

